            "link": "",
            "popup_body": "<h4>Ask us</h4><p>Email is the fastest way, in English. Send the order number and, for anything technical, the firmware version.</p><p><a href=\"mailto:support@ensoshisha.eu\">support@ensoshisha.eu ›</a></p><h4>Help yourself first</h4><p>The first session step by step, the full manual, cleaning and charging, and the firmware app live in ENSŌ Experience, made for the phone.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/experience\">Open ENSŌ Experience ›</a></p><p><a href=\"/pages/contact\">Support page ›</a></p>",
