            "link": "",
            "popup_body": "<h4>What is covered</h4><p>The device, the cap and the electronics for two years, the battery pack for one. Cups, mesh screens and adapters are consumables.</p><h4>How a claim works</h4><p>Write to support with your order number and a photo or a short video. We send a return label; a repaired or replaced unit ships back from the nearest warehouse.</p><p><a href=\"mailto:support@ensoshisha.eu?subject=Warranty\">Write to support ›</a></p><h4>Thirty days to decide</h4><p>Within 30 days of delivery you can return the device in its box for a full refund. Return shipping is on us in the EU and the US.</p><p><a href=\"/pages/warranty\">Full warranty policy ›</a></p>",
